  "goodToKnow": "Baulich means structural or relating to construction: der bauliche Zustand (structural condition), bauliche Mängel (structural defects), bauliche Veränderungen, die tenants need landlord permission for. It's typical in property, planning and insurance language. Der Bau is a building or construction, also prison slang (im Bau sitzen) and an animal's burrow."
